  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>WF-load_sta
Loads the 15 hospital files from ${SOURCE_DIR} into the staging tables (all columns as text).
First empties the staging tables and adm.sta_load_reject, so a rerun never doubles rows.</note>
      <markdown>N</markdown>
